I could not recall Chevron's reported quarterly figures with confidence, so this is a rough estimate, not a calculated result.

I assumed total revenues and other income of roughly $47–49 billion in Q1 2025 and roughly $46–48 billion in Q4 2025. Q4 2025 includes the Hess acquisition, which closed in July 2025 and adds volumes. Lower oil prices in late 2025 offset some of that. Together these point to a small decline of about 2%.

